treatment.  Spool insulators for use with brackets, or devices to support the neutral-messenger of triplex or 
quadruplex, secondary or service cables should conform to ANSI C29.3 Class 53-2.  Use the values in Table II for 
NAVFAC LANT projects.</NPR><BRK/>
